        <body>
            <div xml:id="d959">

                <pb facs="0887" n="797" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg797"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 860d.00/259</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Helsingfors</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Haynes</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 24</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Helsingfors</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15, 1918</hi></date>.
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 22.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to submit a report in
                    duplicate on “Finland’s present political situation as affecting the Allies and
                    the Central powers.”</p>
                <p>This report is written in absolute loyalty and faithfulness to the policy pursued
                    by our Government and is divulged only to the Department for the purpose of
                    furnishing all possible information.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thornwell
                                Haynes</hi></signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d959-a1.xml" xpointer="d959-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
